[patterns/application/extensions/PTN-APP-EXT-017-extension-design-system-integration-pattern.md#example-4-using-design-tokens-for-custom-styling]

#### Example 4: Using Design Tokens for Custom Styling

_[To be completed]_

```typescript
// Custom component using design tokens
import styled from 'styled-components';
import { tokens } from '@gainwell/design-system-react';

const CustomWidget = styled.div`
  padding: ${tokens.spacing.medium};
  background: ${tokens.colors.background.primary};
  border: 1px solid ${tokens.colors.border.default};
  border-radius: ${tokens.borderRadius.medium};
  color: ${tokens.colors.text.primary};
  font-family: ${tokens.typography.fontFamily.body};

  &:hover {
    background: ${tokens.colors.background.hover};
  }
`;
```

